  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reinforcement of the Rule of Law and Strategic Litigation in Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed to reinforce the rule of law in Guatemala through the protection and guarantee of judicial independence and indigenous peoples&#x2019; rights in Guatemala.
The direct impact of working towards this general objective is improved human rights protection, particularly for indigenous people and women and justice will be more equalitarian and pertinent.</narrative>
  </description>
